{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/rat1.gif?t=1746182748\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A quiet wave of break-ins has begun spreading through small towns. No signs of forced entry, no alarms triggered - only missing valuables and a strange symbols left behind. Locals have started to notice the pattern: a rat graffities near the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're one of the few who knows what it means.<br>You work for the one behind it - the Rat Boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rat\u2019s Contracts</strong> is a first-person stealth game about precision, patience, and disappearing without a trace.  There are no weapons and no chaos - only careful movement and calculated execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore environments with non-linear layouts<i>*</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your own approach and pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid detection by civilians and hidden traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete various objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn a rating based on stealth, speed, and efficiency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the fastest route and compete with friends for the best completion time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*The game currently includes one fully designed contract.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/rat2.gif?t=1746182748\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3660130?t=1746182748","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/a5daf3eaf2f99f334f527c7e6c4c943b3a327722/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746182748","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i